---
title: 'Poetry — Faye Wai'
description: 'fragments & echoes — a limited-release poetry chapbook by Faye Wai on heartbreak, home, and healing. Read it page by page.'
ogTitle: 'fragments & echoes — Faye Wai'
ogDescription: 'A limited-release poetry chapbook on heartbreak, home, and healing.'
commissions: false
scripts:
  - js/poems.js
---
<main id="main">
<div class="wrap">

  <header class="hero hero--page grid grid--hero grid--hero-poetry">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow-rule" style="margin-bottom:clamp(26px,4vh,44px)"><span class="eyebrow">Poetry</span></div>
      <h1 class="display h1--page" style="font-size:clamp(34px,4.4vw,68px);max-width:20ch">Poetry is where I put the thoughts that arrived tangled.</h1>
      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:clamp(24px,3.4vh,38px);max-width:54ch">
        <p>I write to slow them down, turn them over, and see what they reveal about my inner world. Sometimes a poem begins with a memory, sometimes a bodily feeling, an image, a joke, a phrase I can’t stop thinking about, or something I’ve been carrying without realising it.</p>
        <p>By the time I reach the end, I usually understand the topic, or myself, a little differently.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="btns" style="margin-top:clamp(28px,4vh,44px)">
        <a class="btn btn--solid" href="#read">Start reading</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tiles tiles--2" style="align-self:end">
      {%- for ph in stage.hero %}
      <div class="frame frame--round r34"><img src="{{ ph.src }}" alt="{{ ph.alt }}"{% if loop.first %} fetchpriority="high"{% else %} loading="lazy"{% endif %}{% if ph.position %} style="object-position:{{ ph.position }}"{% endif %}></div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </header>

  {#- The poems. Everything is in _data/poems.js; js/poems.js opens one over the page. -#}
  <section id="read" class="section" aria-labelledby="poems-h" style="padding-top:clamp(40px,6vh,80px);padding-bottom:clamp(50px,8vh,100px)">
    <div class="section-head section-head--rule" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="h2" id="poems-h">Selected poems</h2>
      <span class="small" style="color:var(--faint)">{{ poems.length }} poem{{ 's' if poems.length != 1 }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="poems">
      {%- for p in poems %}
      <article class="pcard" data-reveal data-poem="{{ p.slug }}" data-title="{{ p.title }}"{% if p.year %} data-year="{{ p.year }}"{% endif %}{% if p.note %} data-note="{{ p.note }}"{% endif %}>
        <h3 class="pcard__title">{{ p.title }}</h3>
        {%- if p.year %}<p class="pcard__meta">{{ p.year }}</p>{% endif %}
        <p class="pcard__lines">{{ p.excerpt }}</p>
        <a class="pcard__go" href="#poem-{{ p.slug }}" data-poem-open>Read poem →</a>
        <div data-poem-body hidden>{{ p.body }}</div>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--rule grid grid--2" aria-labelledby="live-h" style="padding-top:clamp(50px,8vh,100px);padding-bottom:clamp(50px,8vh,100px)">
    <div data-reveal>
      <h2 class="h2" id="live-h" style="max-width:15ch">Come write and read poetry with me</h2>
      <p class="pcard__meta" style="margin-top:16px">Regular open mics + selected features</p>
      <div class="tiles tiles--2" style="margin-top:clamp(30px,4.5vh,48px);max-width:460px">
        {%- for ph in stage.live %}
        <div class="frame frame--round r34"><img src="{{ ph.src }}" alt="{{ ph.alt }}" loading="lazy"{% if ph.position %} style="object-position:{{ ph.position }}"{% endif %}></div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="prose" style="max-width:50ch">Poetry doesn’t only live on the page. I love the spaces where writing becomes something shared — through workshops, open mics, conversation, and responding to life together.</p>
      {%- if workshop %}
      <a class="feature" href="{{ workshop.href }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <div class="frame feature__art r34"><img src="{{ workshop.image }}" alt="{{ workshop.alt }}" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="feature__in">
          <span class="eyebrow">Next up</span>
          <h3 class="feature__title">{{ workshop.title }}</h3>
          <p class="feature__sub">{{ workshop.subtitle }}</p>
          <p class="feature__when">{{ workshop.when }}<br>{{ workshop.where }}</p>
          <span class="feature__cta">{{ workshop.cta }} →</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      {%- endif %}
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--faint" style="display:block;margin-top:clamp(30px,4.5vh,44px)">Selected features &amp; appearances</p>
      <div class="bill">
        {%- for r in readings %}
        <div><span class="bill__name">{{ r.name }}</span><span class="bill__where">{{ r.where }}</span></div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

<section class="panel panel--rule panel--tight" aria-labelledby="chapbook-h">
  <div class="panel__in grid grid--panel grid--end">
    <div data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Chapbook</span>
      <h2 class="display h2--big" id="chapbook-h">fragments<br><span class="i">&amp; echoes</span></h2>
      <p class="prose">A poetry collection in progress. Written to trace heartbreak, home, memory, and becoming across different chapters of a life.</p>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal><div class="frame frame--blush frame--contain sq" style="max-width:260px;margin-left:auto"><img src="assets/chapbook-cover-blush.jpg" alt="fragments &amp; echoes chapbook cover" loading="lazy"></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

</main>
